<section class="viewer">
  <div class="wrap viewerInner">
    <h1 class="viewerTitle">About</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Digital Card Maker is a lightweight tool for creating a shareable digital business card.
      Everything runs client-side: your details stay in your browser, exports are generated locally, and share links encode the card data in the URL.
    </p>

    <div class="ads" aria-label="About details">
      <div class="adCard">
        <div class="adTitle">How sharing works</div>
        <div class="adCopy">
          When you generate a QR code, it points to a public card URL that includes your card data in the hash (the part after <strong>#</strong>).
          This makes it Netlify-friendly and doesn’t require a server database.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="adCard">
        <div class="adTitle">Downloads</div>
        <div class="adCopy">
          You can download a QR-only PNG, a 9:16 phone image, or a business-card sized PNG.
          These are rendered in your browser.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="adCard">
        <div class="adTitle">Privacy</div>
        <div class="adCopy">
          This site doesn’t require an account. If you share a link/QR, anyone with the link can view the card data contained in it.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
